{"title":"Bag","sourceTitle":"Bag/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Bag/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Taschen (21% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bag\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Bag (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bag/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Sac (21% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bag/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Сумка (21% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bag/th\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"กระเป๋า (10% translated)\" lang=\"th\" dir=\"ltr\">ไทย</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Bag/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"背包 (48% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div><p>Uma <b>bag</b> é um item que permite aos jogadores expandir sua capacidade de carga. As sacolas são transportadas em uma seção especial do barra de atalhos, e os jogadores podem equipar até quatro sacolas simultaneamente. Vários tipos diferentes de bolsas estão disponíveis com uma variedade de slots.\n</p><p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Armazenamento\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Armazenamento</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Todas as sacolas podem ser confeccionadas pelos jogadores na grau de confecção. Além disso, o saco de linho pode ser vendido por <a href=\"/Trading\" title=\"Trading\">comerciante de sobrevivência</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Existem 7 bolsas para jogador que podem ser criadas no jogo.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_Hand_basket.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Grid_Hand_basket.png/64px-Grid_Hand_basket.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/13/Grid_Hand_basket.png/96px-Grid_Hand_basket.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/13/Grid_Hand_basket.png/128px-Grid_Hand_basket.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hand_basket\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hand basket\">Hand basket</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hand_basket\" title=\"Hand basket\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Made using <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/reed\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/reed\">reed</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Reed\" title=\"Reed\"> </a></span>s. Adds 3 slots.</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Grid_hunterbackpack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/18/Grid_hunterbackpack.png/64px-Grid_hunterbackpack.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/18/Grid_hunterbackpack.png/96px-Grid_hunterbackpack.png 1.5x, /images/1/18/Grid_hunterbackpack.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"100\" data-file-height=\"100\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hunter%27s_backpack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hunter&#39;s backpack\">Hunter's backpack</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hunter%27s_backpack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hunter&#39;s backpack\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Made using reeds and <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/pelt\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/pelt\">pelt</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pelt\" title=\"Pelt\"> </a></span>s. Adds 4 slots.</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Linensack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Linensack.png/64px-Linensack.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b9/Linensack.png/96px-Linensack.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b9/Linensack.png/128px-Linensack.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Linen_sack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Linen sack\">Linen sack</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Linen_sack\" title=\"Linen sack\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Made using <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/flax\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/flax\">flax</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Flax\" title=\"Flax\"> </a></span> linen and twine. Adds 5 slots.</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Backpack.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Backpack.png/64px-Backpack.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b1/Backpack.png/96px-Backpack.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b1/Backpack.png/128px-Backpack.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Backpack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Backpack\">Backpack</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Backpack\" title=\"Backpack\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">leather]]. Adds 6 slots.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Backpack-sturdy.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f6/Backpack-sturdy.png/64px-Backpack-sturdy.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f6/Backpack-sturdy.png/96px-Backpack-sturdy.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f6/Backpack-sturdy.png/128px-Backpack-sturdy.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy_leather_backpack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy leather backpack\">Sturdy leather backpack</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sturdy_leather_backpack\" title=\"Sturdy leather backpack\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Made using <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/sturdy_leather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/sturdy leather\">sturdy leather</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sturdy_leather\" title=\"Sturdy leather\"> </a></span>. Adds 8 slots.</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Miningbag.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/e9/Miningbag.png/64px-Miningbag.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/e9/Miningbag.png/96px-Miningbag.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/e9/Miningbag.png/128px-Miningbag.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mining_bag\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mining bag\">Mining bag</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mining_bag\" title=\"Mining bag\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Made using flax linen, twine and <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/bronze\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/bronze\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze\" title=\"Bronze\"> </a></span>, <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/iron\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/iron\">iron</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron\" title=\"Iron\"> </a></span> or <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/steel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/steel\">steel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Steel\" title=\"Steel\"> </a></span> plates. Adds 12 slots, but can only hold ores, loose stones, rocks and minerals.</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Miningbagsturdy.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/01/Miningbagsturdy.png/64px-Miningbagsturdy.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/01/Miningbagsturdy.png/96px-Miningbagsturdy.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/01/Miningbagsturdy.png/128px-Miningbagsturdy.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy_mining_bag\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Sturdy mining bag\">Sturdy mining bag</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Sturdy_mining_bag\" title=\"Sturdy mining bag\"> </a></span></span></td>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Made using flax linen, twine, iron or steel plates and sturdy leather. Adds 14 slots, but can only hold ores, loose stones, rocks and minerals.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n<span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<p>Os sacos devem ser colocados em um slot de saco na barra de acesso rápido para terem efeito. Eles fornecem automaticamente mais slots de transporte na tela de inventário. Os itens colocados nos respectivos compartimentos de transporte de uma sacola são armazenados com essa sacola e serão retidos se a sacola for removida do jogador.\n</p><p>Como os jogadores estão limitados à barra de atalhos para espaço no inventário sem bolsa, fazer cestas de mão é uma prioridade muito alta para qualquer novo jogo. A cesta de mão e a mochila do caçador podem ser feitas com materiais de fácil obtenção, proporcionando uma quantidade razoável de espaço no inventário no início do jogo.\n</p><p><span id=\"Storage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Armazenamento\">Armazenamento</span></h2>\n<p>Os slots de bolsa do barra de atalhos podem ser selecionados segurando <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r116235\">.mw-parser-output .keyboard-key{border:1px solid #aaa;border-radius:0.2em;box-shadow:0.1em 0.1em 0.2em rgba(0,0,0,0.1);background-color:#f9f9f9;background-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#eee,#f9f9f9,#eee);color:#000;padding:0.1em 0.3em;font-family:inherit;font-size:0.85em}.mw-parser-output .nowrap{white-space:nowrap}</style><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:MMB.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/f/fa/MMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></a></span> ou <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">1</kbd><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">2</kbd><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">3</kbd><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">4</kbd>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<ul><li>Sacolas vazias podem ser guardadas no <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ground_Storage\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ground Storage\">chão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ground_Storage\" title=\"Ground Storage\"> </a></span>, no inventário e dentro do <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Container#Storage_containers\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Container\">recipientes de armazenamento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Container#Storage_containers\" title=\"Container\"> </a></span>.</li>\n<li>Sacolas contendo itens podem ser guardadas no chão. Seu conteúdo pode ser acessado como um contêiner de armazenamento normal pressionando <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>Bags containing items can be stored on the ground. Their contents can be accessed like a normal storage container by pressing <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r116235\" /><kbd class=\"keyboard-key nowrap\">Ctrl</kbd> + <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>Essas ações são úteis para alternar entre bolsas especializadas ou liberar um slot de bolsa para carregar um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Skep\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Skep\">colmeia</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Skep\" title=\"Skep\"> </a></span> para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Beekeeping\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Beekeeping\">apicultura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Beekeeping\" title=\"Beekeeping\"> </a></span>.\n</p><p><span id=\"See&#95;also\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Container\" title=\"Container\">Recipiente</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/:Category:Guides\">Guias</a><span style=\"display:none\">[[::Category:Guides| ]]</span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\">Perguntas frequentes</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Frequently_Asked_Questions_(FAQ)\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\">Trilha sonora</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Vintage_Story_Original_Soundtrack\" title=\"Vintage Story Original Soundtrack\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Version_history\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Version history\">Versões</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Version_history\" title=\"Version history\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Controls\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Controls\">Controles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Controls\" title=\"Controls\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Sistemas de jogo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Crafting\">Fabricação</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crafting\" title=\"Crafting\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knapping\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knapping\">Lascando</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knapping\" title=\"Knapping\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Clay_forming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Cla